any later version. See the LICENSE file at the repository root.

The hardened runtime's exceptions for the Developer ID build (make_dmg.sh;
notarization requires the hardened runtime). Audio input: the Modulation
panel's microphone or other input, and other apps' audio (the user still
grants each, NSMicrophoneUsageDescription and NSAudioCaptureUsageDescription
in Info.plist). Nothing else is needed: the app isn't sandboxed, so OSC
and Link reach the network as before; Metal compiles its shaders in its own
service; Syphon.framework is signed with the same identity.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>com.apple.security.device.audio-input</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
